    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :printedText """When this enchantment enters, exile up to one target nonland permanent an opponent controls until this enchantment leaves the battlefield. You gain 2 life."""@en ;
    :oracleText """When this enchantment enters, exile up to one target nonland permanent an opponent controls until this enchantment leaves the battlefield. You gain 2 life."""@en ;
    :flavorText """A reliquary is needed to pass through the eclipse safely. Without it, two warring selves will calcify into one."""@en ;
